# NRI tile art

When the user asks to draw / generate / finish map tiles or district sprites:

1. Follow `docs/NRI_TILE_ART_PIPELINE.md` end-to-end.
2. Match **target look** `docs/refs/nri-district-target-look.jpg`: fixed isometric, wet asphalt roads, cohesive building set, neon practical lights, rain + fog atmosphere.
3. Build prompts from `docs/NRI_IMAGE_PROMPT_TEMPLATE.md`; pass the target jpg as `reference_image_paths` when using GenerateImage.
4. Prefer Cursor `GenerateImage` (1:1) for drafts; use PixelLab/other image MCP if configured.
5. Final assets go to `public/map-tiles/` + entries in `shared/nri-map-art/*-gallery.json`.
6. Never commit `tmp/` or `dev.db`. Wip drafts stay under `tmp/art-wip/`.
